# The build context is this directory, and the Dockerfile's `COPY . .` runs
# *after* `uv sync`. Without these exclusions a local .venv would be copied
# over the one built in the image — it is linked to a host interpreter path
# that does not exist in python:3.14-slim, so uv discards it and re-resolves
# every dependency at container start (a hard failure with no network).

.venv/

# Full-account Garmin credentials. .gitignore does not filter the Docker
# build context, so these must be excluded again here or they get baked
# into the image layers.
.env
*.blob
.tokens-*
*.db

# Caches — noise in the image, and stale bytecode from a different Python.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
